  "title": {
   "en": "Shoukan Sukiru o Keishou shitanode, Kiwamete Miyou to Omoimasu! ~Mofumofu Mahou seibutsu to Isekai Life o Mankitsuchuu~"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "召喚スキルを継承したので、極めてみようと思います！～モフモフ魔法生物と異世界ライフを満喫中～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Reincarnated as a Prince With Summon Magic"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "From MangaUpdates:\n\nOne day, an ordinary young man is handed an unexpected gift by a beautiful girl: an “Isekai Reincarnation Ticket.”\n\nBefore he knows it, he awakens as Rufus, a prince in another world!\n\nIn this new world where everyone possesses unique skills, Rufus is granted the Summoning Skill—a rare and powerful ability.\n\nRather than chasing glory or power, Rufus dreams of a laid-back life surrounded by adorable, fluffy magical creatures.\n\nWith his summoning powers, he sets out to master the art, building a cozy, adventure-filled life in a world full of magic, mysteries, and mochi-like cuteness!",
   "ja": "ある日美少女から”異世界転生チケット”を貰った青年は、気付くと異世界の王子・ルーファスに転生。\n誰もがスキルを持つ世界で、彼は付与された「召喚」を生かして、気ままなモフモフ召喚ライフを画策する！"
  },
